        <headline>Flood Warning issued September 25 at 12:20PM EDT until September 26 at 8:00PM EDT by NWS Albany NY</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Minor flooding is forecast.

* WHERE...Hudson River near Poughkeepsie.

* WHEN...From Saturday morning to Saturday evening.

* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...
- At 11:45 AM EDT Friday the stage was 2.9 feet.
- Forecast...The river will oscillate around flood stage with a
maximum value of 4.7 feet early tomorrow afternoon.
- Flood stage is 4.2 feet.
- http://www.weather.gov/safety/flood
</description>
